      {
        "id": "forward-equations",
        "moduleId": "hidden-forward",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材公式：前向计算与退化等价",
        "markdown": "单隐藏层网络的前向计算为\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{H} = \\mathbf{X}\\mathbf{W}^{(1)} + \\mathbf{b}^{(1)}, \\qquad \\mathbf{O} = \\mathbf{H}\\mathbf{W}^{(2)} + \\mathbf{b}^{(2)}.\n$$\n\n把第一式代入第二式可验证：\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{O} = (\\mathbf{X}\\mathbf{W}^{(1)} + \\mathbf{b}^{(1)})\\mathbf{W}^{(2)} + \\mathbf{b}^{(2)} = \\mathbf{X}(\\mathbf{W}^{(1)}\\mathbf{W}^{(2)}) + (\\mathbf{b}^{(1)}\\mathbf{W}^{(2)} + \\mathbf{b}^{(2)}).\n$$\n\n也就是说，对任意权重值都能合并隐藏层，得到参数为 $\\mathbf{W} = \\mathbf{W}^{(1)}\\mathbf{W}^{(2)}$、$\\mathbf{b} = \\mathbf{b}^{(1)}\\mathbf{W}^{(2)} + \\mathbf{b}^{(2)}$ 的等价单层模型。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
